{"seq":2,"slug":"carbohydrates-lipids","title":"高一生物 — 糖类与脂质","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/molecular-biology/carbohydrates-lipids","wordCount":2321,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一生物-糖类与脂质\">高一生物 — 糖类与脂质</h1><p>早晨吃下一碗米饭，身体便获得了充足的能量来源；长跑运动员在赛前大量补充碳水化合物，也是为了让肌肉有足够的&quot;燃料&quot;可用。糖类和脂质是细胞中两大类含碳有机物，它们不仅是主要的能源物质，还承担着构成细胞结构、储存能量和传递信息等多种功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>糖类按照水解产物的数量可分为<strong>单糖</strong>（不能水解的最简单糖）、<strong>二糖</strong>（水解产生两分子单糖）和<strong>多糖</strong>（水解产生许多单糖分子）三大类。脂质则包括<strong>脂肪</strong>、<strong>磷脂</strong>和<strong>固醇</strong>三类，它们在结构上都含有大量的 C—H 键，因此储能效率高于糖类。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>常见代表</th>\n<th>分子通式/特征</th>\n<th>主要功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单糖</td>\n<td>葡萄糖、果糖、核糖、脱氧核糖</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_6H_{12}O_6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（己糖）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_5H_{10}O_5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（戊糖）</td>\n<td>直接供能、构成核酸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二糖</td>\n<td>蔗糖、麦芽糖、乳糖</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{12}H_{22}O_{11}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">22</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>运输糖（植物中蔗糖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多糖</td>\n<td>淀粉、糖原、纤维素</td>\n<td>(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_6H_{10}O_5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>)<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3014em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>储能（淀粉/糖原）、结构支持（纤维素）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脂肪</td>\n<td>甘油 + 脂肪酸</td>\n<td>含大量 C—H 键</td>\n<td>储能、保温、缓冲保护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磷脂</td>\n<td>卵磷脂</td>\n<td>含磷酸基团</td>\n<td>构成细胞膜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固醇</td>\n<td>胆固醇、性激素、维生素 D</td>\n<td>四环骨架</td>\n<td>构成膜、调节代谢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-糖类的分类与功能\">一、糖类的分类与功能</h3><p><strong>单糖</strong>是最简单的糖，不能再水解为更小的糖分子。在生物体中最重要的单糖有：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>葡萄糖（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_6H_{12}O_6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</strong>：细胞生命活动最重要的能源物质。几乎所有生物都利用葡萄糖进行细胞呼吸释放能量。血液中的血糖主要就是葡萄糖，正常浓度维持在 3.9–6.1 mmol/L。</li>\n<li><strong>果糖</strong>：存在于水果中，甜度高于葡萄糖。</li>\n<li><strong>核糖（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_5H_{10}O_5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）和脱氧核糖（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_5H_{10}O_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</strong>：分别是 RNA 和 DNA 的组成成分。核糖比脱氧核糖多一个氧原子，这个细微差别决定了两种核酸截然不同的稳定性和功能。</li>\n<li><strong>半乳糖</strong>：乳糖的组成成分之一，在婴儿营养中具有重要意义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>二糖</strong>由两个单糖分子脱水缩合而成。常见的二糖及其组成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>二糖</th>\n<th>组成单糖</th>\n<th>存在场所</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>蔗糖</td>\n<td>葡萄糖 + 果糖</td>\n<td>植物（甘蔗、甜菜）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>麦芽糖</td>\n<td>葡萄糖 + 葡萄糖</td>\n<td>发芽小麦、淀粉水解产物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乳糖</td>\n<td>葡萄糖 + 半乳糖</td>\n<td>哺乳动物的乳汁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意区分：蔗糖和麦芽糖是植物特有的二糖，乳糖是动物特有的二糖。</p>\n<p><strong>多糖</strong>是由大量单糖聚合而成的高分子化合物。在生物学中最重要的多糖有三种：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>淀粉</strong>：植物体内的储能多糖。大米、面粉、土豆中含有丰富的淀粉。淀粉在人体消化道中被淀粉酶逐步水解为麦芽糖，最终分解为葡萄糖被吸收。淀粉遇碘液变蓝色，这是经典的鉴定反应。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>糖原</strong>：动物体内的储能多糖，也叫&quot;动物淀粉&quot;。其中肝糖原在血糖浓度降低时分解为葡萄糖释放入血液，起调节血糖的作用；肌糖原则在肌肉收缩时就地分解供能。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>纤维素</strong>：植物细胞壁的主要成分。虽然也是由葡萄糖聚合而成，但其糖苷键类型（β-1,4 糖苷键）与淀粉（α-1,4 糖苷键）不同，人体缺乏分解纤维素的酶，因此不能消化纤维素。但膳食纤维对促进肠道蠕动具有重要意义。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"二-脂质的分类与功能\">二、脂质的分类与功能</h3><p>脂质是一类不溶于水但溶于有机溶剂（如乙醇、氯仿）的有机化合物，主要包含三大类：</p>\n<p><strong>脂肪</strong>是由一分子甘油和三分子脂肪酸通过酯键连接而成的三酰甘油。脂肪的功能包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>储能</strong>：单位质量的脂肪储存的能量约为糖类的两倍。这是因为脂肪中 C—H 键比例高，氧化程度低，被氧化时释放的能量更多。</li>\n<li><strong>保温隔热</strong>：皮下脂肪层减少体热散失。北极熊、鲸鱼等寒冷环境动物体内脂肪层尤其厚实。</li>\n<li><strong>缓冲保护</strong>：肾脏周围的脂肪垫起到缓冲外力冲击的作用。</li>\n<li><strong>脂肪酸的种类</strong>：按是否含有碳碳双键分为饱和脂肪酸（动物油脂，常温固态）和不饱和脂肪酸（植物油，常温液态）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>磷脂</strong>的结构特点是用一个磷酸基团替换了脂肪中的一个脂肪酸。磷脂分子具有&quot;头部亲水、尾部疏水&quot;的两亲性，这决定了它在水中自发排列形成双分子层——即细胞膜的基本骨架。脑和神经组织中磷脂含量特别丰富。</p>\n<p><strong>固醇</strong>类物质具有四环碳骨架结构，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>胆固醇</strong>：动物细胞膜的重要组成成分，调节膜的流动性</li>\n<li><strong>性激素</strong>：促进生殖器官发育和生殖细胞成熟</li>\n<li><strong>维生素 D</strong>：促进肠道对钙和磷的吸收</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"三-糖类和脂质的鉴定实验\">三、糖类和脂质的鉴定实验</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>被检测物质</th>\n<th>使用试剂</th>\n<th>实验现象</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>还原糖（葡萄糖、果糖、麦芽糖）</td>\n<td>斐林试剂（甲液 + 乙液）</td>\n<td>砖红色沉淀</td>\n<td>甲乙液现配现用，需水浴加热</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>淀粉</td>\n<td>碘液</td>\n<td>变蓝色</td>\n<td>常温即可反应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脂肪</td>\n<td>苏丹 III（或苏丹 IV）</td>\n<td>橘黄色（或红色）</td>\n<td>需用显微镜观察切片</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>斐林试剂鉴定还原糖的原理：还原糖中的醛基（—CHO）在碱性环境下将 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cu^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 还原为 C<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>O（砖红色沉淀）。注意蔗糖是非还原糖，不与斐林试剂反应。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-糖类与脂质的转化\">四、糖类与脂质的转化</h3><p>糖类和脂质在生物体内可以相互转化。当糖类摄入过多时，多余的葡萄糖首先转化为糖原储存，当糖原饱和后进一步转化为脂肪。这就是&quot;吃糖也会变胖&quot;的生物学基础。反过来，当能量不足时，脂肪可以被分解为甘油和脂肪酸，进而转化为葡萄糖提供能量，但这一过程的效率低于直接利用糖类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一位同学说：&quot;糖类都是甜的。&quot;请根据所学知识判断这句话是否正确，并举出反例。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>实验桌上有三杯无色透明液体：葡萄糖溶液、蔗糖溶液和淀粉溶液。只提供碘液和斐林试剂，设计一套实验方案把三种液体区分开来。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么动物体以脂肪作为长期储能物质，而不是全部以糖原形式储存？从储能效率的角度给出解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>思维拓展</strong>：北极地区的因纽特人传统饮食以高脂肪的海豹肉和鲸脂为主，碳水化合物摄入极少，但他们却很少肥胖或患糖尿病。请尝试从能量代谢和进化适应的角度分析可能的原因。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>纤维素和淀粉都由葡萄糖聚合而成，但人类能消化淀粉却不能消化纤维素。请从分子结构的层面解释两者的差异，并说明牛等反刍动物为何能消化纤维素。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p><strong>脂肪酸与健康</strong></p>\n<p>近年来，&quot;反式脂肪酸&quot;这个词频繁出现在食品标签上。天然的不饱和脂肪酸多为顺式构型，碳碳双键两侧的氢原子位于同一侧。而在食品工业的氢化加工过程中，部分顺式双键会转变为反式构型。反式脂肪酸会升高血液中的低密度脂蛋白胆固醇（LDL-C），增加心血管疾病的风险。世界卫生组织已明确建议消除食品中的人造反式脂肪酸。</p>\n<p><strong>生物柴油——脂质的工业应用</strong></p>\n<p>植物油脂中的脂肪酸碳链长度适中，经过简单的化学处理（酯交换反应）即可转化为脂肪酸甲酯，这就是生物柴油的主要成分。与化石柴油相比，生物柴油可再生、低排放，是绿色能源领域的重要研究方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本节系统学习了糖类和脂质两大类有机化合物。糖类按分子大小分为单糖、二糖和多糖，分别承担直接供能、运输和储能/结构支持的功能。脂质包括脂肪（高效储能）、磷脂（构成细胞膜骨架）和固醇（调节生命活动），它们共同的化学特征是含有大量疏水的 C—H 键。掌握斐林试剂鉴定还原糖、碘液鉴定淀粉、苏丹染液鉴定脂肪的实验原理与操作要点，是本节的重点实验技能。接下来将进入蛋白质与核酸的学习，认识生命活动中最核心的两类生物大分子。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一生物 — 糖类与脂质","id":"高一生物-糖类与脂质"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、糖类的分类与功能","id":"一-糖类的分类与功能"},{"level":3,"text":"二、脂质的分类与功能","id":"二-脂质的分类与功能"},{"level":3,"text":"三、糖类和脂质的鉴定实验","id":"三-糖类和脂质的鉴定实验"},{"level":3,"text":"四、糖类与脂质的转化","id":"四-糖类与脂质的转化"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高一生物 — 水与无机盐","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/molecular-biology/water-minerals"},"next":{"title":"高一生物 — 蛋白质与核酸","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/molecular-biology/proteins-nucleic-acids"}}